  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Urbano Sostenible e Inclusivo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Inclusive Urban Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar el desarrollo urbano sostenible de los municipios del norte de Belice reduciendo los dficits urbanos, fomentando el desarrollo econmico local, promoviendo la inclusin social y econmica de la poblacin migrante y reforzando las capacidades locales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support the sustainable urban development of municipalities from northern Belize by reducing urban deficits, fostering local economic development, promoting the social and economic inclusion of the migrant population, and strengthening local capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
